# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. Never commit real keys.
# Key of GroqCloud (console.groq.com), used by the provider `groq` for every role
# pinned to it. The file is not read by the code: start commands that call a model
# with `uv run --env-file .env ...`, for example
#   uv run --env-file .env omissis run --config <run config> --input <text record>
GROQ_API_KEY=
# Optional further keys, used in turn when one hits its rate limit:
# GROQ_API_KEY2=
# GROQ_API_KEY3=
# The provider `local` (role d3) needs no key: it calls the model server of this
# machine, by default Ollama on http://localhost:11434. Another address must still be
# on this machine (localhost, 127.0.0.1 or [::1]):
# OMISSIS_LOCAL_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1/chat/completions
